I am now in a supermarket.
This supermarket is very bright.
I take a small shopping cart.
I push the cart.
There are many items on the shelves here.
First, I want rice.
I go to the rice section.
Here I see a bag of rice.
This bag is heavy.
I place that bag in the cart.
Now I want yellow dal.
I like yellow dal a lot.
I see a bag of yellow dal.
I take it too.
I place it in the cart.
I walk ahead.
I want other things too.
